// A forwarded cost outside the storable range (the untrusted-input path: a peer
// cell's producer could in principle send anything over the wire) is sanitized
// away to NULL at the consumer, exactly like an in-cell reportedCost with a
// value the NUMERIC(14,6) column can't hold — it must not fault the INSERT or
// cross into the home cell's store as garbage. This is defense in depth: the
// forwarder's own egress sanitize (ingest.CheckpointActivityEvent) already
// drops this before it leaves eu; this proves the home cell would still be safe
// even if a peer predates that guard.
